WEBVTT

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.375
Mom...

00:00:30.417 --> 00:00:33.083
Why... are you in a place like this?

00:00:36.542 --> 00:00:40.417
Why are you here looking just
the way you did when you left me?!

00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:47.875
Why?! Why?!

00:00:49.542 --> 00:00:52.500
Answer me, Mom!

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.000
<i>Zetsubou teki ni kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:05.042
<i>Hanten suru sekai no platonic aishi aou</i>

00:01:11.333 --> 00:01:21.708
<i>Bokura ga miteru sekai wa</i>
<i>itsu demo sakasama de</i>

00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:30.667
<i>Doushiyou mo nai koto de taigai kimatteku</i>

00:01:30.667 --> 00:01:36.292
<i>Namida suru hodo kizutsuku hitomi</i>

00:01:36.292 --> 00:01:42.542
<i>Kokoro de sakebi nagara damatte ita</i>

00:01:42.542 --> 00:01:54.667
<i>Saigo no futari mazare nai</i>
<i>mama byouyomi ga kikoetekuru</i>

00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:59.292
<i>Zetsubou teki ni kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:01:59.292 --> 00:02:05.167
<i>Sutare yuku doubutsu mitai ni aishi aou</i>

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:09.667
<i>Nakitai kurai kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:15.750
<i>Hanten suru sekai no platonic kanjitai yo</i>

00:02:23.583 --> 00:02:25.292
"MI⋅XY"

00:02:25.292 --> 00:02:28.833
Infiltrator in the Alicia Room!
Infiltrator in the Alicia Room!

00:02:29.917 --> 00:02:31.292
The target is alone!

00:02:31.292 --> 00:02:33.083
Close the passage!

00:02:33.083 --> 00:02:34.625
Freeze!

00:02:37.208 --> 00:02:38.708
Hold it.

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:44.917
--It's dangerous!
--Please step back, Sir Izumo!

00:02:44.917 --> 00:02:46.917
Izumo...

00:02:46.917 --> 00:02:48.417
He's...!

00:02:51.375 --> 00:02:53.625
You are the ones who should step back.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:56.833
Wait outside until I give further orders.

00:02:56.833 --> 00:02:59.250
--But...!
--Your concern is unnecessary!

00:03:01.333 --> 00:03:03.167
Please be extra cautious!

00:03:08.125 --> 00:03:10.417
Winged boy...

00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:15.792
To think we'd meet again this soon...

00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:21.417
Why is my mom... I mean,
why is this person here?!

00:03:22.583 --> 00:03:24.083
Answer me!

00:03:26.542 --> 00:03:32.875
Do you know about the curse of Eve
that has been put on Altair?

00:03:32.875 --> 00:03:35.750
Curse of... Eve?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.083
We'll be fine for a while.

00:03:54.083 --> 00:03:55.750
Thanks.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.625
How are you feeling?

00:03:57.625 --> 00:04:00.542
Yeah... My throat is still bothering me a bit.

00:04:02.083 --> 00:04:04.167
Mine, too.

00:04:04.167 --> 00:04:07.292
I wonder if Amata and Andy are okay.

00:04:07.292 --> 00:04:11.958
Don't worry. He promised
that they wouldn't be reckless.

00:04:11.958 --> 00:04:13.583
Yeah...

00:04:14.625 --> 00:04:16.250
Promise...

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:22.083
In return, I want you to promise me something.

00:04:24.625 --> 00:04:26.417
Zessica?

00:04:26.417 --> 00:04:29.208
I-It's nothing!

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:36.750
In this world, we can't see much of
the sky from the ground, can we...?

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:40.208
Yeah, what a weird world.

00:04:40.208 --> 00:04:42.083
I wonder if that's why...

00:04:42.083 --> 00:04:44.500
Maybe because of that,
they really long for the sky,

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:47.250
and that's why they like
"Skies of Aquaria" so much.

00:04:48.667 --> 00:04:51.042
Jin was like that, too.

00:05:02.167 --> 00:05:03.667
Yunoha!

00:05:13.208 --> 00:05:14.917
Damn, I thought we were toast.

00:05:14.917 --> 00:05:16.542
--Huh?
--Huh?

00:05:18.333 --> 00:05:21.083
This means that this place isn't safe, either.

00:05:21.083 --> 00:05:24.208
Seriously, where did Shrade wander off?

00:05:24.208 --> 00:05:27.000
Tell me about it!
That stupid happy-go-lucky guy!

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.000
--What?!
--Ah!

00:05:42.125 --> 00:05:44.333
I see...

00:05:44.333 --> 00:05:49.542
I'm finally getting a grasp of the
melody that dominates this world.

00:05:50.792 --> 00:05:54.000
At any rate, what an unrefined canopy.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.542
This is a place where lives are whittled away.

00:05:59.042 --> 00:06:00.583
Oh, I see...

00:06:02.042 --> 00:06:05.417
This planet is just like me...

00:06:05.417 --> 00:06:09.083
An existence that is
awaiting its impending death.

00:06:09.083 --> 00:06:12.000
That's exactly why I can see...

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:15.000
...the flow of power you expose...

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:18.625
...and where the power is collected.

00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:25.750
You bastards! Let me out!

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:28.750
How dare you lock me up in a place like this?!

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:30.667
Let me out!

00:06:32.417 --> 00:06:37.375
Just kidding... Once I'm inside,
the game is mine.

00:06:37.375 --> 00:06:39.208
Just wait, Mix!

00:06:39.208 --> 00:06:41.583
I'm gonna rescue you for sure!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.792
To find him...

00:06:44.792 --> 00:06:46.208
That's right.

00:06:46.208 --> 00:06:50.875
I came to this town to find
Supreme Commander Fudo.

00:06:52.458 --> 00:06:58.250
I was able to come this far since
he stands out quite a bit, but...

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:01.958
This is all that I can do to help everyone.

00:07:02.917 --> 00:07:05.458
I absolutely won't run this time.

00:07:05.458 --> 00:07:08.958
I'll find the Supreme Commander
and bring him back for sure!

00:07:08.958 --> 00:07:10.458
Right, Shushu?

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.542
Supreme Commander Fudo!

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:47.208
So you finally found me.

00:07:47.208 --> 00:07:48.833
Finally, you say?

00:07:48.833 --> 00:07:51.250
I've been looking all over for you!

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:52.833
You've been looking for me...

00:07:52.833 --> 00:07:57.208
--Yes!
--Why did you need to look for me?

00:07:57.208 --> 00:08:00.208
I've been by your side all this time.

00:08:00.208 --> 00:08:01.375
What?

00:08:01.375 --> 00:08:06.208
In the market, on the streetcar,
and in this harbor town, too...

00:08:06.208 --> 00:08:09.208
I was constantly by your side
at every single moment.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:16.167
Can't be...

00:08:16.167 --> 00:08:21.042
My body remains constant even
in the crossroads of all things.

00:08:21.042 --> 00:08:26.208
My soul will not change for all eternity.

00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:30.333
Never changing... Remaining constant...

00:08:30.333 --> 00:08:31.750
Fudo...!

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:35.500
That's right, remaining constant in all things!

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:38.250
My name is Zen Fudo!

00:08:48.375 --> 00:08:52.500
Don't tell me... Since twelve
thousand years ago, you've been...

00:08:53.583 --> 00:08:56.917
To be precise, it's been since
twenty-four thousand years ago.

00:08:58.167 --> 00:09:03.083
Mikono Suzushiro, do you
want to grasp the whole truth?

00:09:04.875 --> 00:09:09.750
I've decided that I absolutely
will not run this time!

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:13.500
No matter how harsh the truth is...!

00:09:14.583 --> 00:09:17.208
I like that spirit.

00:09:19.083 --> 00:09:24.000
Truth... sometimes can be cruel.

00:09:25.167 --> 00:09:34.250
Fourteen years ago, all the Iguras--
that is, all the women--died out from Altair.

00:09:37.458 --> 00:09:39.958
That's... Jin!

00:09:39.958 --> 00:09:44.625
Jin Musou was the last child born on Altair.

00:09:44.625 --> 00:09:46.333
You get it, don't you?

00:09:46.333 --> 00:09:51.083
The only thing that awaits the world
without Iguras is a slow death.

00:09:51.083 --> 00:09:55.500
So that's why you guys have been
trying to abduct women from Earth!

00:09:55.500 --> 00:10:01.208
We just wanted a mother who'd give
birth to the future of Altair, that's all.

00:10:01.208 --> 00:10:03.958
That's just... your selfish wish!

00:10:07.625 --> 00:10:11.958
I want you to hear me out.

00:10:11.958 --> 00:10:14.542
There is more truth to be told...

00:10:15.625 --> 00:10:18.542
An even crueler truth...

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:26.542
Just wait, Mix!

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.292
Ow!

00:10:33.292 --> 00:10:35.208
--Where am I?
--You bastard!

00:10:35.208 --> 00:10:36.833
You son of a bitch!

00:10:36.833 --> 00:10:39.958
Hey, tell me! Where's Mix?!

00:10:39.958 --> 00:10:41.208
Mix?

00:10:41.208 --> 00:10:45.333
The big-bang girl your boss took and
brought back with him a few days ago!

00:10:45.333 --> 00:10:48.000
Girl? You're talking about that person?

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.542
You know about her?!

00:10:50.833 --> 00:10:53.000
Don't move!

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:57.042
I can make a bigger hole
than that shiny black thing can!

00:10:57.042 --> 00:10:58.833
Wait! Th-That person is...

00:10:58.833 --> 00:11:00.042
--Where is she?!
--Hey!

00:11:00.042 --> 00:11:01.583
What're you doing?!

00:11:07.167 --> 00:11:10.167
You son of a bitch!

00:11:16.417 --> 00:11:19.833
I'll let you off with that.

00:11:19.833 --> 00:11:24.875
Just kidding... My ability to make
holes doesn't work on living things!

00:11:24.875 --> 00:11:26.167
He got away!

00:11:26.167 --> 00:11:27.875
The prisoner has escaped!

00:11:30.375 --> 00:11:36.833
I'm definitely gonna find you
and hold you in my arms! Mix!

00:11:46.875 --> 00:11:48.917
Where are we going now?

00:11:48.917 --> 00:11:51.083
Mikono Suzushiro.

00:11:51.083 --> 00:11:55.417
How does this donut appear to you?

00:11:55.417 --> 00:11:57.417
How...?

00:11:57.417 --> 00:12:00.292
It looks... tasty.

00:12:00.292 --> 00:12:03.542
This donut is at rest in my hand.

00:12:03.542 --> 00:12:09.000
But in reality, it's in motion
at the same speed as this ship.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:10.167
Huh...?

00:12:10.167 --> 00:12:12.458
A donut that's crossing the sea...

00:12:12.458 --> 00:12:15.625
Don't you think that's mysterious?

00:12:15.625 --> 00:12:17.042
What?

00:12:17.042 --> 00:12:19.833
A donut that can disappear...

00:12:19.833 --> 00:12:22.250
Here is the trick.

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:26.250
When things are too close,
sometimes you become unable to see them.

00:12:29.333 --> 00:12:32.458
It's now in your stomach, isn't it...?

00:12:32.458 --> 00:12:34.167
Is that really the case?

00:12:34.167 --> 00:12:36.042
What?

00:12:36.042 --> 00:12:38.417
The fine grains that comprise a donut

00:12:38.417 --> 00:12:41.792
can break down, but never disappear.

00:12:41.792 --> 00:12:46.875
You can also say that after being taken into
my body, they'll forever remain constant.

00:12:46.875 --> 00:12:50.458
Everything you've said
so far is like a Zen riddle.

00:12:50.458 --> 00:12:53.583
What on earth is this
whole truth you mentioned?

00:12:53.583 --> 00:12:56.792
Even after ten thousand years
and two thousand more,

00:12:56.792 --> 00:13:01.833
the eternal Acala is continuing to
support the ground of this planet.

00:13:01.833 --> 00:13:04.250
Eternal Acala?

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:07.542
The legendary Mythic Aquarion...

00:13:07.542 --> 00:13:11.833
It's lying at the end of this journey.

00:13:15.125 --> 00:13:17.458
Dammit!

00:13:17.458 --> 00:13:19.750
I can't find even a single clue!

00:13:20.875 --> 00:13:22.500
--There he is!
--We found him!

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:25.708
He's in section 33 of Floor S!
Send reinforcements immediately!

00:13:25.708 --> 00:13:27.875
Dammit! Stay right there!

00:13:32.917 --> 00:13:34.667
Take this!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:44.417
I told you to stay there, didn't I?!

00:13:44.417 --> 00:13:47.042
Sir Izumo is still in the Alicia Room!

00:13:47.042 --> 00:13:49.667
The infiltrator from Vega is with him!

00:13:49.667 --> 00:13:51.542
Amata!

00:13:51.542 --> 00:13:57.958
The curse of Eve didn't stop when it
removed all the Iguras from our world.

00:13:58.958 --> 00:14:05.125
Those Iguras we brought back from your
world were also affected by that curse.

00:14:06.875 --> 00:14:10.000
However, we finally found...

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:14.708
...an extraordinarily strong Igura who
could reject the curse put on Altair.

00:14:14.708 --> 00:14:17.833
That's right. We found a Rare Igura.

00:14:17.833 --> 00:14:20.292
Rare... Igura?

00:14:20.292 --> 00:14:27.750
But even Alicia, the strongest Rare Igura,
could not be the true Eve, unfortunately.

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:31.958
What gave you the right to take my mom?!

00:14:33.583 --> 00:14:37.583
It was all for Altair to have a future.

00:14:37.583 --> 00:14:39.083
What's this curse thing?!

00:14:39.083 --> 00:14:42.500
What happened to the women
you brought back from the Earth?!

00:14:51.208 --> 00:14:52.750
What's going on?!

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:56.042
The radar and IR sensors
aren't detecting anything!

00:14:56.042 --> 00:14:57.917
Only the gravity wave sensor
has detected something!

00:14:57.917 --> 00:14:59.000
What's the distance?!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.167
The distance is 90!

00:15:00.167 --> 00:15:02.583
--What?!
--80!

00:15:02.583 --> 00:15:04.208
60!

00:15:04.208 --> 00:15:05.750
40!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:07.167
20!

00:15:07.167 --> 00:15:09.208
10!

00:15:09.208 --> 00:15:11.208
The distance is 0!

00:15:16.625 --> 00:15:19.792
Zessica! Yunoha! Are you guys okay?!

00:15:19.792 --> 00:15:21.833
I'm still okay.

00:15:21.833 --> 00:15:24.375
But Yunoha used her power, so she's...

00:15:26.292 --> 00:15:28.417
My body feels hot.

00:15:28.417 --> 00:15:30.292
What's going on?

00:15:30.292 --> 00:15:33.708
What the hell is going on? Dammit!

00:15:35.958 --> 00:15:38.125
My chest...

00:15:38.125 --> 00:15:40.958
What on earth is happening to their bodies?

00:15:40.958 --> 00:15:42.708
Can you hear me, Shrade?!

00:15:42.708 --> 00:15:45.792
Andy! So you're okay! Where are you?

00:15:45.792 --> 00:15:48.625
I'm in the tower underneath your legs!

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:04.542
That was quite a flashy return.

00:16:04.542 --> 00:16:07.125
Where's Amata? He isn't with you?

00:16:07.125 --> 00:16:10.500
It sounds like he's in a room
called the Alicia Room.

00:16:13.958 --> 00:16:15.208
Can't be...

00:16:15.208 --> 00:16:16.667
It's the truth.

00:16:16.667 --> 00:16:21.583
That is indeed the curse of Eve put on Altair.

00:16:21.583 --> 00:16:23.667
I can't believe it!

00:16:23.667 --> 00:16:27.000
We couldn't either, at first.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:30.542
But if you see it with your
own eyes, you're forced to...

00:16:35.042 --> 00:16:37.208
This is Spada's sword!

00:16:37.208 --> 00:16:39.042
Mechanical Angel?!

00:16:39.042 --> 00:16:41.250
Amata! Get in, now!

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.625
Shrade?!

00:16:42.625 --> 00:16:44.125
I'm here, too!

00:16:44.125 --> 00:16:45.375
Andy!

00:16:45.375 --> 00:16:49.375
Hurry up! Or Zessica and Yunoha won't last!

00:16:50.375 --> 00:16:52.208
Amata...

00:16:52.208 --> 00:16:54.500
So that's your name...

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:58.958
There's one more thing that I need to tell you.

00:16:58.958 --> 00:17:01.792
Your father is...

00:17:01.792 --> 00:17:02.833
Sir Izumo!

00:17:02.833 --> 00:17:04.125
Please step back!

00:17:04.125 --> 00:17:05.875
That's him! Fire!

00:17:13.083 --> 00:17:14.583
Mom...!

00:17:19.833 --> 00:17:22.000
I summoned the reserve Vector machines!

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.833
Andy! Amata! Board them!

00:17:24.833 --> 00:17:26.833
--Got it!
--Roger!

00:17:32.417 --> 00:17:34.833
Yunoha! Zessica! Fly above
us and stand by there!

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:37.750
I'm sorry.

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:39.375
We'll leave...

00:17:39.375 --> 00:17:41.042
...things here...

00:17:41.042 --> 00:17:42.458
...to you idiots...

00:17:42.458 --> 00:17:44.583
Yunoha! The way you're talking...!

00:17:44.583 --> 00:17:46.583
More importantly, we've got
our enemy to deal with!

00:17:48.417 --> 00:17:51.417
Without the women's beautiful concerto,

00:17:51.417 --> 00:17:54.958
I can't play the forbidden melody, but...

00:17:54.958 --> 00:17:56.875
--Here we go!
--Yeah!

00:17:56.875 --> 00:18:01.167
Boys' Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:18:09.792 --> 00:18:12.500
Aquarion Spada!

00:18:15.125 --> 00:18:17.542
Sorry, but we don't have much time.

00:18:17.542 --> 00:18:20.500
I'll play the fastest toccata!

00:18:22.667 --> 00:18:25.167
The moon of men plays the...

00:18:25.167 --> 00:18:27.167
...Moonlight Rhapsody!

00:18:38.667 --> 00:18:40.292
Spatial Augmentation!

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:44.833
--What?!
--The thruster nozzle is filled!

00:18:45.833 --> 00:18:47.333
It was filled?!

00:18:54.458 --> 00:18:56.500
Can't be right! That power is...

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:58.542
That's Mix!

00:18:58.542 --> 00:19:00.042
What?!

00:19:02.042 --> 00:19:03.167
Hm?!

00:19:03.167 --> 00:19:07.083
Oh, that's the guy who tricked us earlier.

00:19:07.083 --> 00:19:08.708
That wasn't funny!

00:19:08.708 --> 00:19:11.625
You've got it wrong!
You've got it wrong, Andy!

00:19:11.625 --> 00:19:13.750
Wh-What're you saying?!

00:19:15.125 --> 00:19:16.667
The curse of Eve...

00:19:17.792 --> 00:19:21.083
Even if they do manage to survive,

00:19:21.083 --> 00:19:29.042
the Iguras who come to Altair will
become a man physically and mentally.

00:19:29.042 --> 00:19:30.667
Become a man...?

00:19:30.667 --> 00:19:34.417
This is the karma given to us...

00:19:34.417 --> 00:19:39.375
This is the curse of Eve,
which hinders new lives from being born!

00:19:40.542 --> 00:19:45.833
That's Mix, whose memories have
been manipulated by the Altair military!

00:19:49.542 --> 00:19:51.333
Can't be...

00:19:51.333 --> 00:19:54.458
If that's Mix, then I...

00:19:54.458 --> 00:20:00.875
I didn't realize that I had already
been reunited with the woman I love?!

00:20:00.875 --> 00:20:04.042
Oh, damn. This isn't funny.

00:20:04.042 --> 00:20:05.042
Yunoha!

00:20:05.042 --> 00:20:07.750
Oh, no... I'm fainting, too...

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:11.667
Shrade! We need to get out of here right away!
Or we'll be like cornered rats!

00:20:11.667 --> 00:20:14.542
But even if we are able to
make it above the canopy,

00:20:14.542 --> 00:20:16.625
as long as we are in this world...

00:20:20.792 --> 00:20:24.792
Mix!

00:20:24.792 --> 00:20:27.792
Mix!!

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.333
Andy!

00:20:30.333 --> 00:20:34.167
What do I do?!

00:20:34.167 --> 00:20:36.250
Tell me!

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:38.958
His Element power has gone out of control!

00:20:38.958 --> 00:20:42.000
He's creating a hole in the air!

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:44.083
It's a nano black hole!

00:20:48.625 --> 00:20:51.292
Stop it! Stop it, Andy!

00:20:51.292 --> 00:20:56.417
No. I'll conduct that dark scale using my baton!

00:20:59.625 --> 00:21:02.500
The place where the scales intersect...

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:05.750
The point where the power that pierces
space and time is concentrated...

00:21:11.125 --> 00:21:17.417
Andy! I'll put your power into
this arrowhead and release it!

00:21:17.417 --> 00:21:20.125
Black Hole Arrow!

00:21:33.875 --> 00:21:35.583
The gate opened!

00:21:37.667 --> 00:21:39.500
Amata...

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:41.333
It's your turn now.

00:21:49.167 --> 00:21:51.250
Yunoha! Zessica!

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:54.792
Mix!

00:21:54.792 --> 00:21:58.958
Mix!!

00:22:03.125 --> 00:22:07.708
No... My name is Mixy!

00:22:09.250 --> 00:22:13.000
Oh... how wonderful!

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:16.583
The jigsaw puzzle that is full
of gaps is now coming together.

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:20.375
The awakening of the sleeping wing...

00:22:20.375 --> 00:22:26.000
It comes hand-in-hand with
the revival of Solar Wing.

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:32.208
The defective Eve was useful
in its own way after all.

00:22:32.208 --> 00:22:34.708
Its awakening draws near.

00:22:34.708 --> 00:22:38.708
It won't be long now, other half.

00:22:38.708 --> 00:22:42.167
Everything will go back to where it started...

00:22:42.167 --> 00:22:46.125
...and the last puzzle will be completed.

00:22:59.292 --> 00:23:07.208
<i>Kimi e tsuzuku sakamichi ni</i>
<i>shiroi hana ga saiteta</i>

00:23:07.208 --> 00:23:14.833
<i>Yume kara sameta ato mo kanashii sora miteta</i>

00:23:19.417 --> 00:23:25.208
<i>Kono kimochi happa no ura ni sunderu</i>

00:23:26.833 --> 00:23:34.667
<i>Asatsuyu ga ochiru oto ni mimi o sumaseteru no</i>

00:23:34.667 --> 00:23:42.458
<i>Kami sama anata ga tsukutta</i>
<i>sekai wa kanpeki ja nai</i>

00:23:42.458 --> 00:23:50.250
<i>Koko de wa mainichi koi ga</i>
<i>poroporo shinde yuku</i>

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:54.083
<i>Hajimete suki ni natta no</i>

00:23:54.083 --> 00:23:57.375
<i>Anata wa shiranai desho</i>

00:23:57.375 --> 00:24:01.833
<i>Chikyuu no uragawa de ii kara</i>

00:24:01.833 --> 00:24:05.042
<i>Soba ni ite hoshikatta</i>

00:24:05.042 --> 00:24:09.542
<i>Watashi o wasurete mo ii kara</i>

00:24:09.542 --> 00:24:15.625
<i>Soba ni ite hoshikatta</i>

00:24:19.625 --> 00:24:24.208
I wish I could rewind everything
and go back to where it started.

00:24:24.208 --> 00:24:28.500
What I've lost and what I'm afraid I might lose...

00:24:30.458 --> 00:24:31.667
"Next Episode 'Kiss'"
I can't help but get unsettled when I think about them.

00:24:31.667 --> 00:24:33.542
"Next Episode 'Kiss'"
Next time! "Kiss."
